# NOTE: patterns below use `**/out/...` (not `out/...`) because a pattern containing a slash
# anywhere but the end is anchored to THIS .gitignore's own directory (`chains/fuel/`) per git's
# matching rules -- the old unprefixed `out/*` only ever matched a top-level `chains/fuel/out/`,
# which stopped existing once this workspace split into per-package dirs (`train/`,
# `payout_curve/`, `interfaces/`, `test_asset/`, each with their own nested `out/`). Left as
# `out/*` it silently ignored NOTHING for any of them -- discovered while building this port's
# deployment tooling (`scripts/deploy/artifacts.ts` reads straight out of these directories) and
# fixed here since compiled bytecode/ABI JSON should never be git-add-able regardless of which
# package produced it.
**/out/*

target/

# Per-run deployment records (machine-generated; addresses get curated into DEPLOYMENTS.md by
# hand instead) -- mirrors the EVM port's own gitignored `deployments/`.
deployments/
